// The assertion checks that the baud_freq parameter is always <= (global_clock_freq / gcd(global_clock_freq, 16 * baud_rate))
// Since the parameters are static, we use a one-time check at time 0
assert property (@(posedge clock) (1'b1) |-> (baud_freq <= (40000000 / gcd(40000000, 16 * 115200))));
```

